UID:260820e_vKwZIWqUWj19rORpv0FQ
DESCRIPTION:We can understand how the Earth has changed through time throu
 gh studying rocks\, geochemistry and geobiology. Join us to explore Osborn
  Preserve landscape through a geological lens. Find out how Sonoma Mountai
 n and the surrounding area was formed while hiking through the unique land
 scape at the Osborn Preserve. \n\nThis event is part of the Naturalist Ed
  Series. The event within this Series allows participants the option to be
 come Osborn naturalists to address Nature Deficit Disorder. No experience 
 required. Must be age 18 years or older.
LOCATION:Fairfield Osborn Preserve
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/sonoma-mountain-geol 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
