BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sherita Perez
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T000000
UID:260813hcj63RlGX0eVK1V9XWKutg
DESCRIPTION:Sherita Perez is a unique singer-songwriter and entertainer th
 at creates memorable songs from authentic experiences with a heart-felt so
 und that draws listeners into the moment. People say her voice has a class
 ic sound that echoes the styles artists like Stevie Nicks\, Janis Joplin\,
  and Dolly Parton. Her roots lie in Texas and she continues to grow and cu
 ltivate her music style on the road\, touring both nationally and internat
 ionally. 	Sherita recently preformed at SXSW Official\, Austin City Limi
 ts live Radio Broadcast at The Towns Van Zandt Hotel in Austin\, TX.  Sher
 ita has opened for Joan Osborne and James McMurtry. Sherita has supported 
 shows for Ani DeFranco\, The String Cheese Incident\, and Taj Mahal. Recen
 tly\, Sherita was a performer at the 25th Annual Kate Wolf Music Festival 
 and The Hog Farm Hideaway 2022 at The Black Oak Ranch in Laytonville\, CA\
 , as well as played at The Golden Gate Band Shell in San Francisco\, CA.
  Sherita has been featured on BMI's Singer-Songwriter Series at The Saxo
 n Pub and the Texas Music Office's Texas Music Mixtape KOOP Radio- Origina
 l Music Hour alongside Willie Nelson\, Nora Jones & Shiny Ribs. Sherita al
 so has an artist sponsorship with Berkeley Mandolins and received a schola
 rship SWRFA 2022. Sherita’s Song\, “Pack it In/Pack It Out” will be 
 featured as Joshua Trees National Parks PSA this year. Follow Sherita’
 s tour schedule at Linker.ee/SheritaPerez.
LOCATION:Ferry Taproom
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108636621?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
