 ng you to the unique encaustic technique in an approachable and creative w
 ay.\n\nIn this workshop\, you will:\n\n• Learn the basics of encaustic \
 \(wax\\) collage techniques\n\n• Layer papers\, textures\, and wax to cr
 eate a unique mixed media artwork\n\n• Leave with a finished piece ready
