DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T120000
UID:26080300sjde63f0OG9vDVeV1ksg
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, August 22\, 2026\n\n10:00 AM – 12:00 PM\n\nLocati
 on\n\nRoom 109\, Rotary Kitchen\n\nCategory\n\nCulinary Arts\n\nExperience
  Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$100
 \n\nMaterials Fee:\n\nAll Materials Included\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n
 \n$100\n\nThere’s something deeply satisfying about pulling a tray of go
 lden empanadas from the oven\, and Gerardo Diaz will show you exactly how 
 it’s done. Over the course of the morning you’ll mix and roll your own
  dough\, spoon in savory fillings\, and get comfortable with the crimped e
 dge that seals each pocket shut. Expect hands-on practice\, helpful guidan
 ce\, and a few tricks that turn a good empanada into a great one. You’ll
  head home with a batch of your own and a recipe worth making on repeat. R
 eserve your spot and come hungry.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/get-your-hands-in-the-dough
 -empanadas/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Art of Kokedama: Japanese Moss Ball Planting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T180000
UID:260728R8ZJ87mdtUi5WccxFT3onQ
DESCRIPTION:With Cathrina of Cat Hawk Gardens\, “The Kokedama Mama”\n\
 nDiscover the Japanese art of kokedama—living plant arrangements wrapped
  in moss. Guided by Cathrina of Cat Hawk Gardens\, you’ll explore this m
 indful practice of balance\, beauty\, and simplicity while creating your o
 wn kokedama to take home.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• Learn tradi
 tional techniques for forming and binding moss balls\n\n• Make your own 
 kokedama to take home\n\n• Gain skills to continue creating on your own
 \n\nAll supplies provided. Includes a grounding Self-Breema movement pract
 ice to connect body and mind.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-art-of-kokedama
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Hyperion Inaugural Release
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T180000
UID:2607288VdZwJLk6UeimHYtzKz8eQ
DESCRIPTION:We didn't set out to follow tradition. We set out to explore w
 hat's possible. \n\nThe Hyperion is Redwood Empire's most ambitious whisk
 ey yet and the inaugural release in our annual exploration of what's possi
 ble in American whiskey. Inspired by the world's tallest tree and crafted 
 to move the category forward\, it represents our Master Distiller and Mast
 er Blender's pursuit of what's next. \n\n*The name is public. The whiskey
  remains a secret.* \n\nJoin us at our Mare Island distillery for the offi
 cial unveiling with live music\, Buckhorn BBQ + Grill\, custom cocktails\,
  and exclusive first access. \n\nOne year. One whiskey. Never repeated.\n
 \n**Club & VIP Experience | 12–3pm**\n\nWhiskey Club members are invited
  upstairs for an elevated experience:\n\n• Complimentary access for Club
  members + one guest\n\n• Exclusive tasting of the new annual release\n\
 n• Private bar\n\n• Complimentary bites from Buckhorn BBQ + Grill\n\n
 • Live acoustic music \n\n• Meet-and-greet opportunities with our dis
 tillers\n\n• Shaded terrace seating and additional indoor lounge areas\n
 \n• Must be 21+\n\n*Limited number of VIP tickets - include a bottle of 
 The Hyperion and access to the Club & VIP experience.* \n\n**General Admis
 sion | 2-6pm**\n\n• First opportunity to purchase bottles of our inaugur
 al annual release\n\n• Specialty cocktails\, whiskey flights\, beer & wi
 ne available for purchase\n\n• Live DJ set from 2-6pm\n\n• Buckhorn BB
 Q + Grill offerings available for purchase\n\n• Access to our downstairs
  celebration spaces\n\n**Bottle Sales & Club Pickups**\n\n• New release 
 pre-sales available - buy now\, pickup 8/22\n\n• Club allocation pickup 
 in designated bottle sales area\n\n• Show ticket or club perks card to p
 ick up\n\n**Whiskey Bar & Tour Reservations**\n\n• Whiskey Bar seating f
 irst come\, first served - no reservations\n\n• No Distillery Tours\n\n*
 *Additional Details:**\n\nPublic Whiskey Bar Hours: 2pm-8pm. GA areas open
  to the public and all ages. Pets prohibited indoors - service animals onl
 y. All guests will be IDd and wristbanded accordingly on entry.
LOCATION:Redwood Empire Whiskey Bar & Tasting Room
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/redwoodempirewhiskey/event/616817/the-hype
 rion-inaugural-release-day
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
