SUMMARY:Sol Horizon
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T130000
UID:2608210PQWDjCY3kqRzjov73PELA
DESCRIPTION:Join Sol Horizon at Goatlandia Farm Animal Sanctuary's Annual 
 Gala & Fundraiser\, Reggae To The Rescue\, on SATURDAY\, AUGUST 22ND from 
 1-5pm \\(VIP 1-5pm\, GA 2-5pm\\) at Goatlandia Farm Animal Sanctuary in Se
 bastopol. \n\nReggae to the Rescue 🎶🐐 brings music\, community\, and
  compassion together to support rescued farm animals at Goatlandia. Join u
 s at Goatlandia's biggest fun-raising party of the year! Get into the isla
 nd vibe with music from Sol Horizon\, tropical eats and drinks from Goatla
 ndia Kitchen\, beer from Russian River Brewing\, and of course\, time with
  Goatlandia's rescued animals. And Goatlandia always dresses up at their p
 arties - so don't forget to dress in your brightest island colors!\n\nBy r
 egistering\, you help create a safe\, joyful haven for goats\, pigs\, chic
 kens\, and more\, and fuel Goatlandia's work to promote kindness toward an
 imals\, people\, and the planet. Sign up\, show up\, and let the rhythm ca
 rry your care into real-world rescue.\n\nVIP hour is from 1pm-2pm\, which 
 includes a special welcome drink\, appetizers\, and a guided tour from Goa
 tlandia's founder\, Deborah! General admission begins at 2pm. All tickets 
 include a delicious plant-based buffet. \n\nTICKETS ARE ON SALE NOW!\n\n$5
 0 Child Admission \\(Ages 2-12\\)\n\n$100 General Admission 2pm \\(Ages 13
  and over\\)\n\n$175 VIP \n\n\\(Enjoy a special VIP reception hour from 1-
 2pm with a special welcome drink\, appetizers\, and a guided tour from our
  founder Deb! You will also enjoy front-row seating.\\)\n\n$200 VIP Plus \
 n\n\\(Enjoy a special VIP reception hour from 1-2pm with a special welcome
  drink\, appetizers\, and a guided tour from Goatlandia's founder Deb! You
  will also enjoy front-row seating. VIP Plus includes reserved parking rig
 ht up front!\\)\n\nSHOW INFO\n\nSol Horizon\n\nVIP Doors - 1:00pm\n\nGA Do
 ors - 2:00pm\n\nSol Set 1 2:30 - 3:15pm\n\nSol Set 2 3:45 - 4:45pm\n\nAll-
 Ages\n\nSOL HORIZON\n\nSol Horizon has been Sonoma County\, California’s
  premier reggae band for the past 25 years. The band was voted “Best Ban
 d” in the North Bay Bohemian’s “Best of the North Bay” Reader’s 
 Picks in 2022 and 2023\, as well as winners of the NorBay Award for “Bes
 t Reggae Band” in the North Bay 9 times\, including the last 5 years in 
 a row and 8 of the previous 9 years. Anchored by veteran musicians\, Sol H
 orizon fuses roots reggae with dub\, jam\, rock\, funk\, and world music. 
 The band is renowned for its energetic live performances and powerful lyri
 cal content centered on themes of peace\, love\, positivity\, community\, 
 connection\, sustainability\, the healing power of music\, and the revital
 izing power of nature.
LOCATION:Goatlandia Farm Animal Sanctuary
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108706266?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
