DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T153000
UID:260419yRWSQszFGEqheI-XpM3seA
DESCRIPTION:Every Sunday: Free\, live jazz every week performed by some of
  the best musicians in the SF Bay Area and beyond\, right in the heart of 
 downtown Petaluma! Every Sunday from 1 to 3:30\, local jazz bassist and mu
 sic book publisher Chuck Sher presents a rotating ensemble of professional
 \, veteran jazz musicians in Putnam Plaza Park\, right next to the Speakea
 sy. In partnership with Music in Place\, Jamey Aebersold Jazz Books\, JamB
 ar\, and MadCap Labs\, this event started in 2020 and has since become a s
 taple for locals and visitors alike. Stop by and enjoy some of the best ja
 zz the Bay Area has to offer!
LOCATION:Putnam Plaza Park
URL:https://www.facebook.com/jazzintheplazapetaluma
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:How to Start Beekeeping - A Free Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T163000
UID:2608136guAOfwnpEWCoTmT0HsLXg
DESCRIPTION:Interested in keeping honey bees? Whether you're simply curiou
 s or ready to start your own hive\, this free program by the Master Garden
 ers of Sonoma County will provide practical introduction to the rewarding 
 world of beekeeping.\n\nNo registration needed.\n\nTom Courry\, a beekeepe
 r with 45 years of experience and a longtime member of the Sonoma County B
 eekeepers Association\, will share an informative introduction to backyard
  beekeeping.\n\nTom's presentation will cover the fundamentals of beekeepi
 ng\, including:\n\n• Essential beekeeping equipment • Choosing the ide
 al location for your hive • Basic colony management • What to expect a
 s a beginning beekeeper\n\nFollowing the presentation\, enjoy a guided tou
 r of the Unity Demonstration Garden to learn about some of the best plants
  to support honey bees and other pollinators. See less
LOCATION:Petaluma Bounty Community Farm
URL:https://ucanr.edu/site/mg-sonoma/event/how-start-beekeeping-planning-h
 oney-bees-your-backyard
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
