BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:HONKY TONK ROADSHOW & JAMBOREE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T180000
UID:26081074ckHUL9UEq8UnYmVkxRmQ
DESCRIPTION:FOPPIANO VINEYARDS and BLUE BRIDGE BOOKING present a summer af
 ternoon of music and artisan pizza at the HONKY TONK ROADSHOW AND JAMBOREE
 .\n\nFeaturing CLEMENTINE DARLING\, RANDY ROSS\, plus an open mic jam wit
 h guest musicians.\n\n 3–6 PM\n\n$10 ADVANCE \\(free to Club\\) | $15 A
 T THE DOOR\n\nAll Ages Welcome\n\nWine Available for Purchase\n\nWood-fire
 d Pizza Direct from the Oven\n\nFriendly\, Leashed Dogs Welcome\n\nNo Outs
 ide Alcohol or Glass Containers On the Lawn Please\n\nABOUT THE ARTISTS:\n
 \nCLEMENTINE DARLING is an Americana Folk Singer-Songwriter with her heels
  dug deep in San Francisco Bay Area’s music scene. Originally from Seatt
 le\, Washington\, Darling busked her way down the West Coast in 2010\, on 
 a road trip that led her to put down roots in Sonoma County\, California. 
 The two locals influenced her debut 11:11 EP and subsequent Live At The Lo
 st Church— a collection of introspective songs and soulful ballads\, wit
 h undertones of Seattle 90’s grunge.\n\nIn May 2023\, Darling released h
 er third independent album Bootstraps EP\, a collection of songs that spin
  a tail of overcoming\, hope\, and chasing dreams on horseback. Darling ha
 s found her confident\, soulful voice playing music all around the Bay Are
 a\, and at festivals including The Emerald Cup\, sharing the bill with Mar
 go Price and Rising Appalachia\, SXSW\, Railroad Square Music Festival and
  Balanced BreakFEST.\n\nFind her at www.clementinedarling.com\, or on Inst
 agram @clementinedarlingmusic\n\nRANDY ROSS is an Americana and country so
 ngwriter. Fresh off the release of his EP “Hard Days\, Soft Nights\,” 
 the Nashville‑via‑Phoenix singer blends heart‑on‑sleeve lyrics\, d
 usty barroom stories\, and a warm\, lived‑in voice. Find him at @randyra
 yross
LOCATION:Foppiano Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/foppianovineyards/event/618779/honky-tonk-
 roadshow-jamboree
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
