 len serves up a Sunday night favorite featuring crispy fried chicken coate
 d in a sticky\, sweet-and-spicy hot honey glaze. Each plate comes with a t
 hick slice of herbed focaccia and a refreshing side of Sunray Farm cucumbe
 r\, mint\, and dill tossed with citrus vinaigrette. This flavorful combina
 tion makes for a satisfying comfort-food experience with a fresh\, seasona
 l twist. Available for dine-in or to-go\, guests can enjoy this weekly Sun
 day special from the comfort of the restaurant or take it home for a delic
 ious feast. To place a to-go order\, call Songbird Parlour at \\(707\\) 34
 3-1308. For pre-orders\, contact the restaurant by phone or email by Frida
 y at 5 p.m.
LOCATION:Songbird Parlour
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/epic-hot-honey-fried-chix-night-at-songbi
 rd/
