BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Photographer Becky Jaffe to present at the Napa Valley Photographi
 c Society
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T203000
UID:260817QeFrxy3nG0mLuClH65oAYg
DESCRIPTION:Please join fellow photography enthusiasts for Becky Jaffe’s
  presentation on The Art of Seeing.\n\nA photographer and educator\, Becky
  Jaffe exhibits her photography in over forty museums and galleries nation
 wide\, curates multimedia exhibits in community art centers and greenhou
 ses\, teaches Art of Seeing courses for fine art photographers\, and j
 udges photography competitions for over a dozen Northern California camer
 a clubs. Her photographs have been published in LensWork\, SHOTS Magazine\
 , Der Greif\, the San Francisco Chronicle\, and Bay Nature Magazine. She w
 as the 2019 Artist-in-Residence at the University of California at Berkel
 ey Botanical Garden\, where she teaches photography workshops that cross-p
 ollinate the arts and sciences\, using an artistic lens to study ethnobo
 tany\, ecology\, and evolutionary biology. She teaches photography interna
 tionally as a lecturer for Cal Discoveries Travel in countries such as Jap
 an\, Australia\, Panama\, and Egypt. She uses her photography practice as 
 a way to cultivate and share a sense of raw wonder.\n\nTo learn more about
  Becky’s upcoming exhibits\, classes\, and workshops\, and to purchase p
 rints of her images\, check her website\, https://www.beckyjaffephotograph
 y.com/contact  \n\nNapa Valley Photographic Society \\(NVPS\\) promotes t
 he art and science of photography\, providing education\, image appreciati
 on\, inspiration\, and exchange of technologies. Most months\, we invite g
 uest speakers to evaluate our images.  Guests are welcome to attend.  Ch
 eck the website for more information: http://www.napavalleyphotographicsoc
 iety.org.
LOCATION:Napa Senior Center
URL:http://www.napavalleyphotographicsociety.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
