UID:260812TEGzw-Kjfk2lHq_sHxebdA
DESCRIPTION:Our weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg Plaza from 6:00 p
 . m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up of bands\, and ha
 ve been assembled to please a wide array of musical interests. Food vendor
 s will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale starting at 5:00 
 p. m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m.\n\nAbout the band: The band is
  known for its rock-infused interpretations of Neil Diamond's classic hits
 \, often incorporating heavier guitar riffs and contemporary influences fr
 om bands like Guns N' Roses and AC/DC. This approach has allowed Super Dia
 mond to stand out in the tribute band scene\, attracting a diverse audienc
 e. 1 Super Diamond has performed at numerous prestigious venues across the
  United States\, including The Fillmore\, House of Blues\, and Irving Plaz
 a. Their shows are characterized by high energy and a commitment to celebr
 ating Neil Diamond's musical legacy\, often resulting in sell-out performa
 nces.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Plaza
URL:https://healdsburg.gov/335/Tuesdays-in-the-Plaza
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
