 AM – 7:00 PM\\)\, with Live Music on the Patio from 4:00 PM – 7:00 PM.
 \n\nThis Wednesday is also a Sip & Support Day! We are partnering with Sun
 rise Horse Rescue and their mission to rescue\, rehabilitate\, and provide
