 r The Costeaux Community Table Series starting August 26. Come meet the fa
 rmers behind the flavors.\n\nCommunity Table Dinner | $85 per person (excl
 udes beverages and gratuities)\n\nAugust 26 Preston Parm + Winery\n\nSepte
 mber 9 Farmprenuers + Old World Winery\n\nSeptember 23 Front Porch Farms +
