BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Brandlin Estate Wine & Food Tasting Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T160000
UID:260312gITSACdHYUaQkwauS82PAA
DESCRIPTION:Born on the rugged slopes of Mount Veeder\, Brandlin Estate pr
 oduces wines of structure\, intensity\, and place. The Brandlin Experience
  offers an in-depth exploration of this historic vineyard site through a c
 urated tasting of five estate-grown wines—including Zinfandel from centu
 ry-old vines and the estate’s signature Cabernet Sauvignon. This seated\
 , guided experience invites guests to delve into the mountain terroir thro
 ugh the lens of small-lot winemaking. Each wine reflects the elevation\, e
 xposure\, and rocky soils that define the Brandlin Estate. For an added di
 mension\, guests may opt to include seasonal bites\, thoughtfully paired t
 o complement the structure and complexity of the wines. This experience is
  hosted at the picturesque Boathouse.
LOCATION:Brandlin Estate 
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/brandlinestate/experience/565565/the-brand
 lin-wine-food-tasting-experience?date=2026-03-12&size=2&time=10%3A00
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wednesday Prime Rib Night at Songbird
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T210000
UID:260821ycUfWO_xnUC9-JvARiKQbA
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday Prime Rib Night at Songbird Parlour in Glen Ellen se
 rves up a hearty midweek favorite featuring slow-cooked\, herb-crusted pri
 me rib. Tender and juicy\, each cut is served with flavorful natural jus a
 nd fresh horseradish for the perfect finishing touch. Choose between a gen
 erous 12-ounce portion or go big with a 16-ounce cut for an especially sat
 isfying meal. With its rich flavor\, tender texture\, and classic accompan
 iments\, this weekly special is a must for prime rib lovers. Join Songbird
  Parlour every Wednesday evening for a relaxed dinner featuring a seriousl
 y delicious cut of meat and welcoming Sonoma atmosphere.
LOCATION:Songbird Parlour
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/wednesday-prime-rib-night-at-songbird-202
 6-08-26/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
