BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fifteen Minutes for Moms at Sebastopol Center for the Arts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T113000
UID:260821fIp_OBx2akWm5ZzDmFz_Sg
DESCRIPTION:This series of short\, practical talks is designed to give mot
 hers and caregivers simple\, actionable tools to support their financial s
 ecurity\, physical health\, and mental well-being. Each session is 15 minu
 tes or less and focuses on one key topic participants can immediately put 
 into practice. Topics include: Money for Moms - Understanding Social Secur
 ity benefits and simple strategies to strengthen future retirement income 
 while raising young children. Stress Relief & Pelvic Stability Through Bre
 athwork - A five-minute breathing routine to reduce stress and support pel
 vic and postural health. Fighting Anemia & Essential Postpartum Health Che
 cks - Important information on anemia\, iron and ferritin levels\, Vitamin
  D\, thyroid health\, and other key postpartum screenings.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
URL:https://events.sonomalibrary.org/event/family-storytime-ives-park-1054
 26
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
