 s built around one simple idea: great music brings people together.\n\nThe
  Marquee Club’s intimate setting puts you close to the stage\, where eve
 ry vocal\, every groove and every spontaneous moment happens just a few fe
 et away. Come early\, settle into a table\, have dinner and drinks\, and l
 et the evening build as the lights go down and the band kicks in.\n\nLoral
 ee brings together classic rock\, vintage soul\, blues and American roots 
 music without treating them like museum pieces. These are songs meant to b
 e sung\, danced to\, remembered and shared.\n\nThe Empress Marquee Club ne
 xt door will be open for dinner at 5:30 p.m.
