  you to the 10th Annual Mosaic Gala on August 27 at 5:00 p.m.\, held outdo
 ors on the beautiful Farragut Inn Lawn. A special thank you to NorthBay He
 alth\, our 2026 Presenting Sponsor\, for their generous support. Stay conn
 ected and learn more: https://my.onecause.com/event/organizations/sf-0013c
 00001uTc3KAAS/events/vevt:779d50d0-d6ca-4f64-999e-bdd0d264b1b4/home/story 
