DESCRIPTION:dBRx is a high-octane\, woman-fronted\, professional 4-piece b
 ased in the SF Bay Area. Our blend of powerful\, soulful rock is always bi
 g\, even when it’s soft. From Audioslave to Zeppelin\, our set is an alc
 hemy that might bring together Christina Aguilera and Ozzy\, INXS and Riva
 l Sons\, or Sir Elton and Alanis Morissette\, and it all works beautifully
 .\n\n     From the crowd-pleasers that get everyone on their feet\, to fre
 sh revivals of deep but familiar cuts\, our performances turn heads\, rais
 e eyebrows and bring energy and joy to every show. \n\nVenues love working
  with us. \n\n     We have many years of experience performing in a wide v
 ariety of settings in the Bay Area. We typically use no amps and have our 
 own in-ear monitor feed\, so we’re just a straight feed to your front of
  house. That means we’re flexible\, we set up quickly\, have a small foo
 tprint and our levels can be whatever you need. And we’re chill people t
 hat like to make life easy for venues.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern Novato
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1039603407?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
