  night.\n\nA vibrant\, romantic atmosphere to enjoy your partner’s compa
 ny.\n\nWhy You’ll Love Salsa Date Night:\n\nLearn Something New Together
 : Stepping out of your comfort zone as a team is one of the best ways to s
 trengthen your bond. Our expert instructors break down the steps so simply
  that even those with two left feet will be moving with confidence.\n\nQua
 lity Time Together: Between work\, chores\, and daily stressors\, it’s e
 asy to end up just “co-existing” on the couch. This night forces you t
 o log off\, look into each other’s eyes\, laugh through the missteps\, a
 nd truly enjoy each other’s company.\n\nA Vibrant Atmosphere: Great musi
 c\, high energy and fantastic time..\n\nNo prior dance experience needed
 —just bring your partner\, comfortable shoes\, and an open mind.\n\nSpac
 es are limited to ensure plenty of room on the dance floor. Reserve your s
 pot today and give your partner a night to remember!\n\nDATE: EVERY 4th Fr
 iday 7:30 PM\n\nCOST: $50 \\(per couple\\)\n\nADDRESS: 4140 Redwood hwy 8
 \, San Rafael
