 endly lounge to spark creativity\n\n● Optional ticket upgrades include p
 aint kits\, bracelet making\, face paint\, body art\, and more\n\nTicket T
 iers\n\nEarly Bird - $15\n\nGeneral Admission to the Lounge\, dance floor\
 , and your choice of 1 gram of flower or 1 infused\n\nmocktail.\n\nGeneral
  Admission – $25\n\nGeneral Admission to the Lounge\, dance floor\, and 
 your choice of 1 gram of flower or 1 infused\n\nmocktail.\n\nGeneral Admis
 sion \\+ Glow Paint Party – $35\n\nGeneral Admission to the Lounge\, dan
 ce floor\, and your choice of 1 gram of flower or 1 infused\n\nmocktail\, 
 plus a paint kit \\(easel\, canvas\, brushes\, and neon paints\\).\n\nGene
 ral Admission \\+ Goodie Bag – $35\n\nGeneral Admission to the Lounge\, 
 dance floor\, 1 infused cocktail\, plus $35\\+ Goodie Bag\n\nGeneral Admis
 sion \\+ Premium Goodie Bag – $50\n\nGeneral Admission to the Lounge\, d
 ance floor\, 1 infused cocktail\, plus a $50\\+ Goodie Bag\n\nVIP Couch Cr
 ew Pass \\(3 Guests\, paint kits\, \\+ VIP Goodie Bag\\) - $150\n\nGeneral
  Admission to the Lounge\, dance floor\, 3 infused cocktails\, 3 paint kit
 s \\(easels\, canvases\,\n\nbrushes\, and neon paints\\) plus a $50\\+ Goo
 die Bag\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Condition
 s\n\nThis event is 21\\+ only. Valid government-issued ID is required for 
