 's hungry. What can Boy do but give Mouse a cookie? Wouldn't you do the sa
 me thing? But if you give a mouse a cookie\, he's going to want a glass of
  milk...\n\nJody Davidson's adaptation\, based on the books by Laura Joffe
  Numeroff\, is a mayhem- and mishap-filled joyride for all audiences.\n\nS
 how details\n\nAuthors: Adapted by Jody Davidson\, based on the books by L
 aura Joffe Numeroff\n\nLocation: Cinnabar Theater Studio Space\, 2200 Peta
 luma Blvd N.\, Suite 700\, Petaluma\n\nPerformance dates: Sat Aug 22 \\(11
 am & 2pm\\)\, Sun Aug 23 \\(11am\\)\, Sat Aug 29 \\(11am & 2pm\\)\, Sun Au
 g 30 \\(11am\\)\n\nEstimated run time: 60 minutes\n\nRecommended for ages 
 3\\+. Children under 3 are welcome to attend at the discretion of their pa
 rent or caregiver. You know your child best! If your little one is ready f
 or a live theater experience\, we’d love to have them join the adventure
 .\n\nTickets: https://cinnabartheater.org/show/mouseacookie/
