DESCRIPTION:FELLOWSHIP UNITED METHODIST CHURCH\n\n85TH ANNIVERSARY CELEBRA
 TIONS\n\n"NEW FACES\, ABUNDANT REVIVAL"\n\nAUG 29\n\nDinner & Dance Celebr
 ation\n\nJoin us for dinner\, dancing & other fun activities for all! Thro
 ughout the night\, we will hear stories & testimonies from members - shari
 ng their ministries & what they have found meaningful at Fellowship UM. Yo
 u can obtain tickets at tinyurl.com/FUMC85\n\nTime: 5:00 PM - 9:00 PM\n\nL
 ocation: 420 Admiral Callaghan Ln\, Vallejo\, CA 94591\n\nAUG 30\n\nWorshi
 p Service Celebration\n\nJoin us for service as we explore this year's the
 me of "New Faces\, Abundant Revival." We will weave this theme throughout 
