  for a potluck meal & fellowship!\n\nTime: 10:00 AM - 11:30 AM\n\nLocation
 : 140 Ladera Dr. Vallejo\, CA 94591\n\nFellowship United Methodist Church 
 - 85th Anniversary\n\nTicket Distribution Form tinyurl.com/FUMC85\n\nHello
  Fellowship UMC Family!\n\nOur church's 85th Anniversary celebration is se
 t for Saturday\, August 29\, 5:00 PM – 9:00 PM. It will be held at the V
 allejo Veterans Building\, 420 Admiral Callaghan Lane\, Vallejo\, CA 94591
 . The suggested donation is $40\, but no one will be turned away! Checks c
 an be made out to Fellowship UMC with the note "85th Anniversary Ticket." 
