 e here at Fellowship UMC\, as the night will include testimonies and a sha
 ring of gifts and talents. So maybe think of one person who isn't a regula
 r attendee of Fellowship UMC and invite them to our celebration! Once you'
 ve filled out the form\, Cynthia Duncil will distribute the number of tick
 ets requested on an available Sunday. If you find you won't be able to use
