DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T111500
UID:260812ABplbGgf70mMBPbPHME3TQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an outdoor mat Pilates session hosted by Club Pila
 tes\n\nJoin us for an outdoor mat pilates class at Montgomery Village host
 ed by Club Pilates. This full-body workout helps to enhance core strength\
 , flexibility and body awareness through controlled movements. Designed to
  be low-impact and accessible\, this class is perfect for all fitness leve
 ls—whether you're just getting started or looking to deepen your practic
 e.\n\nFollowing class\, enjoy live music and complimentary refreshments. P
 lus\, attendees are invited to stop by ME SPA at 728 Farmers Lane to pick 
 up product samples\, try a complimentary LED demo\, and book an appointmen
 t on the spot for 10% off. Snap a photo at their spa selfie station and en
 ter for a chance to win a 50-minute massage or facial. L'Occitane will als
 o be on-site guiding a DIY facial experience at their wash station\, the p
 erfect post-workout treat.\n\nBy registering and attending this class\, yo
 u acknowledge that you have read and understand this Release and Waiver an
 d accept and agree to the terms and provisions contained in this Release a
 nd Waiver.\n\nThis outdoor event will be held atThe Courtyard\, located be
 tween Salt & Straw \\(700 Village Court\\) and Monti's \\(714 Village Cour
 t\\). Please wear layers\, sunscreen and don't forget your sunglasses!\n\n
 Mats will be provided\, but you are welcome to bring your own mat for addi
