DESCRIPTION:We are excited to bring you the **8th Annual Real Neato Music 
 Festival** on Saturday\, August 29\, 2026 from 2-10PM. at the Rio Nido Roa
 dhouse in Guerneville\, California.\n\nThis single-day festival takes plac
 e in West Sonoma County’s most picturesque setting—the Russian River V
 alley. Two stages provide non-stop live music from legendary and up-and-co
 ming Bay Area Indie bands. Majestic coastal redwoods provide the perfect b
 ackdrop for the best little festival in Northern California.\n\nIt's a fun
 -filled day of music\, delicious food and drinks\, local makers\, and plen
 ty of good\, mellow vibes. \n\nPresented by TruEcho\, The Rig Mobile Venu
 e\, and Fleetwood with the Rio Nido Roadhouse.\n\nGENERAL ADMISSION:\n\n
 • Earlybird Tickets are available while supplies last!\n\n• Advance ti
 ckets are available now until day-of show or sold out.\n\nADDITIONAL
  TICKET OPTIONS:\n\n• Tickets at reduced price are available for kiddos 
 12 and under.\n\n• We love your animal friends\, but per Roadhouse rules
 : no pets.
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse
URL:https://realneato.com
