SUMMARY:44th Annual Sand Sculpture Contest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T000000
UID:251218ePzYoNACWEmpp0hePZlnrQ
DESCRIPTION:For 2026\, the Annual Sand Sculpture Contest will be held on t
 he Saturday before Labor Day weekend. Registration begins at 9 am Judging 
 begins at noon Prizes awarded at 3 pm We welcome all ages at this free com
 munity event located at Drakes Beach. Categories include: Children \\(four
 teen years of age and under\\)\, Families\, Adults. Three prizes will be a
 warded in each of those categories\, along with prizes for the "People's C
 hoice" sculpture. Only materials found on Drakes Beach may be incorporated
  into the structure. Do not pick plants or pull rocks or gravel from the c
 liffs. Build above the high tide line and away from the cliffs for your sa
 fety. Please be aware that parking will be extremely limited during the co
 ntest and Drakes Beach will be heavily impacted with contest participants.
  If possible\, please carpool with friends. To avoid crowds here\, please 
 consider visiting another beach in the park. This event is family based\, 
 but please remember no  dogs are allowed on this designated swimming beach
  \\(no lifeguard on duty\\). Bring a picnic and spend the day! The PRNSA p
 ark store adjacent to the Kenneth C. Patrick Visitor Center will be open f
 rom 9:30 am to 4:30 pm on Saturday\, August 29\, 2026. There will be hot a
 nd cold drinks\, snacks\, sandwiches\, books\, and gifts for sale.
LOCATION:Drake's Beach Drake's Beach Road Inverness
URL:https://www.marinmommies.com/calendar/44th-annual-sand-sculpture-conte
 st
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
