DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260830T000000
UID:260327A5hVCm1zs0qRUyld5DHh3Q
DESCRIPTION:Lynn Crossett travels between Central Texas and Southern Calif
 ornia performing songwriting-focused Indie Americana music. In a follow-up
  to his 2022 album\, In the Company of a Song\, which debuted at No. 6 on 
 the Roots Music Report Top 50 Americana Country Album Chart and stayed in 
 the top 10 for eight weeks\, he is back working with Grammy Award-winning 
 producer Lloyd Maines on his latest release\, Autumn to August. Released o
 n June 20\, 2025\, the album debuted at No. 4 on the same chart and reache
 d No. 1 the following week.\n\n“Lynn Crossett pens songs about longtime 
 friendships\, realizations that come on over time\, and that nagging sensa
 tion that finding yourself isn’t about where you reside\, or where you r
 oam. They’re all brewed in a Texas style Americana.” \\(Elise Cady\, A
 mericana Highways\\)\n\nWith the release of Autumn to August\, Lynn is emb
 arking on a full-time music career and a more ambitious national and inter
 national touring schedule following his latest album release in June 2025.
LOCATION:Napa River Inn
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108050025?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
