BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jumpstart Your Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260831T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260831T160000
UID:260629GLEg_80iA065mXXfAbTI2Q
DESCRIPTION:Every person experiences an ebb and flow to the tides of their
  creativity. We will share space together to design\, exchange ideas\, and
  hold ourselves accountable to our unique interests! The first portion of 
 our time together will involve a check-in discussion of ‘what is'\, lead
 ing into ‘what could be'. The talk will be facilitated by Erin Partridge
 \, an art therapist with a long history of supporting people in reengaging
  with creativity. After our initial talk\, we will have some time to indiv
 idually focus on our creative practices in the space of the gallery. Befor
 e we close\, we will share anything that came up in the process. Bring you
 r ideas\, a project\, and an interest in creative community. Please be min
 dful of what you choose to show up with-something quiet\, easy to clean up
 \, and non-disruptive to your fellow creatives. Not sure where to begin? S
 ome basic materials are available\, thanks to a donation from  Blick Art M
 aterials . Open for all ages-youth under 12 with an adult chaperone please
 ! Mondays\, 1-4 PM Facilitator: Erin Partridge
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Monday Jazz Jam
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260831T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260831T220000
UID:260820u5h_6Yh1zkKcOIMM2nLFoA
DESCRIPTION:Bring your instrument\, bring your friends\, and settle in for
  a night of live jazz at the Empress Marquee Club. Monday Jazz Jam is a we
 lcoming\, musician-friendly evening where players can sit in\, listeners c
 an enjoy a relaxed club atmosphere\, and the music moves naturally from sw
 inging standards to blues\, ballads\, Latin grooves\, and spontaneous impr
 ovisation.\n\nTogether\, they’ll anchor the night with taste\, experienc
 e\, and musical flexibility\, giving guest musicians a strong foundation t
 o step up and join the jam. Whether you’re a horn player\, vocalist\, gu
 itarist\, percussionist\, bassist\, pianist\, or simply a jazz lover\, thi
 s is a night built around community\, creativity\, and live interaction.\n
 \nMusicians play free and get dinner\, making this one of Vallejo’s most
  inviting weekly gatherings for working players\, students\, seasoned impr
 ovisers\, and music fans alike.\n\nThe jam runs from 7 PM to 10 PM\, with 
 doors and dinner beginning at 6 PM.
LOCATION:Empress Marquee Club
URL:https://empresstheatre.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
