DESCRIPTION:Guitarist\, producer and bandleader Steve Freund was praised b
 y Rolling Stone for his "masterful\, no-nonsense guitar work" and has appe
 ared on over 50 albums\, including the legendary Koko Taylor’s Grammy-wi
 nning “Blues Explosion.” Steve was Sunnyland Slim's main guitarist and
  has also worked with Big Walter Horton\, Floyd Jones\, and harmonica lege
 nd James Cotton.  In addition to his guitar career\, Steve is an accomplis
 hed piano accompanist who has worked with Pinetop Perkins\, Jimmy Walker\,
  Henry Gray\, Erwin Helfer and many more. Daniel Castro learned his craft 
 in the South Central L.A. blues clubs alongside “Mighty Mouth” Delmar 
 Evans\, before recording and touring with artists including Small Faces si
 nger-bassist Ronnie Lane. In 1995\, he formed The Daniel Castro Band\, rel
 easing two albums under that name. He now plays regularly with bassist Joh
 nny Yu and drummer David Perper. Doors open at 5pm. Show Starts at 6pm.
LOCATION:ca 95401
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2966550683677588/
