 elissa Stewart and Allen Young. What exactly do monkeys have to do with ch
 ocolate? Find out\, plus taste test chocolate & investigate its properties
 . October 7 "I Was: The Stories of Animal Skulls" by Katherine Hawker & Na
 tasha Donovan. Investigate owls and dissect a pellet. November 4 "The Spac
 esuit: How a Seamstress Helped Put Man on the Moon" by Alison Donald and A
 riel Landy. Sew a small planet or spacecraft.
