 d celebration of songs\, crossing the genres of Folk\, Jazz\, and Rock\, a
 ll composed by the incomparable singer/songwriter\, Joni Mitchell. With Ka
 te Foley-Beining on vocals\, piano\, dulcimer\, and guitar\, backed by Son
 oma County jazz greats: Tom Shader on bass\, Kevin Dillon on drums\, and C
 hristian Foley-Beining on electric guitar\, the Joni Mitchell Situation ex
 plores with humor and depth Mitchell's range of sounds and styles\, from b
 allads to Jaco-infused jazz art songs. Always new selections from Joni's e
 xpansive songbook.
