BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Harvest Cooking: Learn and Lunch with Stephanie Klassen
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T130000
UID:260820FTEHkJK4406FxW7kFoh6cA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the flavors of the Mediterranean with this relaxed s
 ummer lunch menu. Learn how to make the most of your backyard or farmer's 
 market bounty with this demonstration class taught by local cookbook autho
 r Stephanie Klassen.\n\nShe'll show you how to turn those overflowing bask
 ets of summer veggies into a cool Summer Garden Gazpacho\, a colorful Prov
 encal Vegetable Galette and Green Bean-Feta Salad. (And don't forget Nonna
 's Olive Oil Cookies for dessert!) After the demo\, we'll sit down togethe
 r for an al fresco lunch overlooking our beautiful organic orchards.\n\nWh
 at to Expect:\n\n\\*A hands-on cooking demonstration in our charming Apple
  Cottage kitchen\n\n\\*Expert tips from Stephanie on creating delicious di
 shes using fresh\, local produce\n\n\\*A sit-down lunch featuring the dish
 es you just watched being made\, enjoyed at a table overlooking our apple 
 orchard\n\n\\*A signature refreshment: citrus shrub\, freshly pressed appl
 e cider or apple cider spritz\\*\n\nA scenic ride in our apple-themed trol
 ley from the Farm Shop to the Apple Cottage\n\n\\*10% off all Farm Shop pu
 rchases on the day of the class\n\nStephanie Klassen is the author of seve
 n cookbooks\, including A Little Taste of San Francisco and Honey from Flo
 wer to Table. She has taught seasonal cooking at farmers markets and other
  venues from Brooklyn to Berkeley\, including the Ferry Plaza Farmers' Mar
 ket in San Francisco and the Gravenstein Apple Fair in Sebastopol. She has
  cooked at numerous artists' and writers' retreats including the Headlands
  Center for the Arts in Sausalito\, and studied organic farming at the Cen
 ter for Agrocology at UC Santa Cruz.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/618724/harv
 est-cooking-learn-and-lunch-with-stephanie-klassen
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
