BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Stephen Malkmus Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T220000
UID:260802DMkrGVq090yq1atwTvc4zQ
DESCRIPTION:Stephen Malkmus Concert – Presented by \\(\\(\\(folkYeah!\\)
 \\)\\) and Gundlach Bundschu on Friday September 4\, 2026 at 6:00pm at the
  Gundlach Bundschu Amphitheater in Sonoma\, CA. \n\nStephen Malkmus is a s
 inger and guitarist in the groups Pavement\, The Jicks\, and the Hard Quar
 tet and was a member of Silver Jews. A graduate of the University of Virgi
 nia and a tennis enthusiast\, he lives in Chicago. \n\nWHEN: Friday\, Sept
 ember 4th 2026 \n\nWHERE: GB Amphitheater \n\nTIME: Doors 5:00pm | Show 6:
 00pm \n\nBUY TICKETS\n\n  \n\nTICKETING: Have your ticket ready when you
  arrive! If you opted for mobile delivery\, please make sure it’s ready 
 to go on your phone. Printed tickets? Have them out and ready to be scanne
 d. Bacchus Club members\, enjoy express entry with your special line and a
  complimentary welcome splash of wine. \n\nPARKING: Parking is compliment
 ary for Bacchus Wine Club members and available to pre-purchase online. To
  encourage carpooling\, we offer free parking to vehicles with 3\\+ passen
 gers\, full 2-seaters\, motorcycles\, and electric vehicles. Otherwise\, p
 arking will be $20 cash at entry. For ADA accommodations please let the pa
 rking attendant know and we encourage contacting us in advance. \n\nPLEASE
  NO: \n\nCoolers\n\nWater \\(bring an empty bottle as we have filtered re-
 fill stations\\)\n\nPets\n\nChairs\n\nOutside food or drink\n\nBad Attitud
 es… this is Rhinefarm after all\n\nACCESSIBILITY: For any questions re
 garding ADA accommodations related to parking\, seating\, restrooms\, etc.
  please contact us at info@gunbun.com or 707.938.5277. \n\nYOUR EXPERIEN
 CE\, YOUR ADVENTURE: At Gundlach Bundschu Winery\, we invite you to immer
 se yourself in the magic of our outdoor amphitheater\, where the beauty of
  nature blends with unforgettable performances. As with all great adventur
 es\, attending an outdoor event carries a touch of unpredictability. \n\nW
 hether it’s the rustle of the vines in the breeze\, the gentle slope of 
 the hillside\, or the surprises nature has in store\, we encourage you to 
 embrace the moment. While we strive to create a safe and enjoyable environ
 ment\, the great outdoors brings its own set of risks. By joining us\, you
  understand and accept the inherent possibilities\, but not limited to\, u
 neven ground\, changing weather\, and the occasional visit from our local 
 wildlife. We ask that you tread carefully\, come prepared for all conditio
 ns\, and remember to look after yourself and your belongings. \n\nBy atten
 ding our events\, you acknowledge that your participation is voluntary\, a
 nd you assume all responsibility for any personal injuries\, accidents\, o
 r loss of property that may occur during your time with us. Gundlach Bunds
 chu Winery and its team are dedicated to your safety\, but cannot be held 
 liable for incidents that may arise from the natural elements of this expe
 rience. \n\nIn purchasing a ticket and joining us under the open sky\, you
  agree to these terms and release Gundlach Bundschu Winery from any claims
  or liabilities associated with the inherent risks of an outdoor gathering
 . We look forward to sharing this special place with you\, where every mom
 ent is part of the journey.
LOCATION:GB Amphitheater
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/stephen-malkmus-concert/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
