DESCRIPTION:Are you a curious student who wants to learn computer programm
 ing? Or are you an intermediate coder who is looking to take their skills 
 to the next level? 404 Found\, a local high-schooler organized nonprofit\,
  is hosting a 8-week series on HTML at the Rincon Valley Regional Library.
  Join us from 4:00 PM to 5:45 PM on Fridays in September and October and c
 reate your very own website! Please sign-up for each session separately 9/
 4: HTML Basics Part 1 9/11: HTML Basics Part 2 9/18: CSS Styling Part 1 9/
 25: CSS Styling Part 2 10/2: Icons\, fonts\, and embedding 10/9: Project d
