BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Opening Day Celebration: Dia de los Muertos
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T170000
UID:260816rRDgU4DpHUKcgdUykFvPGA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the opening of the Museum of Sonoma County's 30th an
 nual Día de los Muertos exhibition! Explore beautifully crafted ofrendas 
 created by local artists and community members honoring the lives and memo
 ries of loved ones. Throughout the day\, enjoy family-friendly art activit
 ies from 11:00 am–2:00 pm\, including papel picado\, paper flowers\, sku
 ll mask making\, and more.El Día de los Muertos\, or Day of the Dead\, is
  celebrated throughout Mexico\, many Central and South American countries\
 , and within communities across the United States. Rooted in ancient tradi
 tions\, it is a joyful celebration of the cycle of life that honors the me
 mories of family members and loved ones who have passed away.Join us for a
  day of art\, creativity\, and community as we kick off this beloved annua
 l tradition.
LOCATION:Museums of Sonoma County
URL:https://tickets.museumsc.org/?tab=Events&view_date=&period=Weekly&mode
 =Event&event=1783708477280x114722688847314940
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
