 r. \n\nSee this amazing cast of drag\, burlesque\, and variety performers
  take the stage:\n\nCal Cadian (Bay Area)\, Shiza Minnelli (South Bay)\, B
 abraham Lincoln (Santa Cruz)\, Mimic Velour (North Bay)\, Paige Turner (Ba
 y Area)\, Ophelia Coeur de Noir (Sonoma)\, Ashanti Altovese (Bay Area)\, J
 agOff AllTrades (Bay Area)\, Titus Androgynous (North Bay)\, Velvet Thorn 
