DESCRIPTION:Join Vallejo Choral Society as we begin rehearsing our Decembe
 r program\, In the Stillness\, insightfully curated by Artistic Director
  Julia Morris. We'll sing Gerald Finzi’s Magnificat\, op. 36\, an expre
 ssive work featuring soaring choral melodies\, paired with Antonio Vivaldi
 ’s Gloria\, RV 589\, a radiant masterpiece celebrated for its driving rh
 ythms and uplifting spirit. For our concerts December 12 in Benicia and De
 cember 13 in Vallejo\, the Symphonic and Chamber Choirs will be joined by 
 a Chamber Orchestra.
