BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Meet the Author: John Perkins
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260909T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260909T190000
UID:260820vdbNVfqda0eBFiI4gUQdsA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening with John Perkins\, bestselling author 
 of Confessions of an Economic Hit Man\, as he discusses his latest book\, 
 The Art of the Steal: Trump and the Economic Hit Man Presidency. In his ne
 west work\, Perkins argues that the "economic hit man" strategies he wrote
  about in his bestselling memoir have evolved and now influence American p
 olitics in new ways. Drawing on decades of experience as an economist and 
 author\, he explores themes of power\, economics\, democracy\, and global 
 influence. Following the presentation\, attendees will have an opportunity
  to ask questions and engage in a discussion with the author. Whether you'
 ve followed Perkins' work for years or are simply interested in contempora
 ry politics\, economics\, and current affairs\, this event offers a chance
  to hear directly from one of the most widely discussed voices in politica
 l and economic nonfiction.
LOCATION:Vallejo John F. Kennedy Library
URL:https://solanolibrary.libnet.info/event/16935048
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
