BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Origins: Choral Re-imaginings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T210000
UID:2608105VB9FW069EG0Xf-qSHS6sQ
DESCRIPTION:Join **Aeternum**\, California's professional chamber choir\, 
 for a moving evening at Mont La Salle Chapel. *Origins* explores the Renai
 ssance’s greatest hits like Allegri’s Miserere\, Byrd’s Mass for Fiv
 e\, and more\, alongside their re-imagined works by today’s most excitin
 g living composers. \n\nProgram:\n\nHildegard von Bingen — Ave generosa
 \n\nWilliam Byrd — Ave verum corpus\n\nRoderick Williams — Ave verum c
