 22 Brandlin Estate Old Vine Zinfandel\n\n**Herbed Beef Meatballs**\n\nsmok
 ed eggplant puree | shaved parmesan\n\n2023 Brandlin Estate Cabernet Sauvi
 gnon\n\n2019 Brandlin Estate Cabernet Sauvignon\n\nBrandlin Estate Boathou
 se Wine & Food Pairing Experience: $195/person\n\n**Cuvaison Menu** **for 
 July 1st – September 30th**\n\n**Feta Mousse | Roasted Corn | Charred Ap
 ricot | Radish**\n\ntoasted brioche bread\n\n2023 Cuvaison ATS Chardonnay\
 n\n**Herbed Beef Meatloaf**\n\ntomato jam | sautéed capers & cocktail oni
 ons\n\n2023 Cuvaison Adda Pinot Noir\n\n**Mushroom Quiche Tartlet**\n\npap
 rika crema | chives\n\n2023 Cuvaison Arcilla Merlot\n\n**Moroccan Chicken 
 Skewer**\n\nred bell pepper sauce | evoo | sunflower seed crumble\n\n2022 
 Brandlin Estate Henry’s Keep\, Red Wine\n\n2023 Cuvaison Diablo Syrah\n\
 nCuvaison Boathouse Wine & Food Pairing Experience: $180/person
