 usage poll 5.2 Kunde Fund Bequest Summary: The current balance of funds on
  deposit is $248\,849. 5.3 Review of LAB By-Laws 5.4 Outreach ideas 5.5 Yo
 uth LAB member 5.6 LAB recruitment 5.7 Updates from LAB members on current
  projects ACTION ITEMS 6.1 Appointment of LAB Secretary 6.2 Vote on moving
  to hybrid LAB meeting \\(in-person and Zoom\\) 6.3 Adjournment DATE OF NE
 XT MEETING: THURSDAY February 12\, 2026 TIME OF NEXT MEETING: 4:00 PM
