 eaturing Junk in the Trunk & The Spot**\n\nJoin us for a fun\, high-energy
  Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in downt
 own Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and classic c
 omfort food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the lively sounds of Junk
  in the Trunk with delicious burgers and comfort favorites from The Spot.\
 n\nJunk in the Trunk brings an upbeat mix of familiar favorites and dancea
 ble tunes\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and social eveni
 ng surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s win
 es by the glass or bottle while The Spot serves juicy burgers along with o
 ther crowd-pleasing menu items\, made fresh and satisfying.\n\nFriday | 5:
 00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 event insi
 de the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the pa
 tio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County nigh
 t of great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine available for purc
 hase Live music by Junk in the Trunk Food by The Spot (burgers and comfort
  favorites) Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Str
 eet\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
