BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Outdoor Movie in the Park - A Good Year
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260911T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260911T220000
UID:260821PtCv7sTMFEi2KZZARFNPRw
DESCRIPTION:Yountville Arts Movie in the Park \\(a good year-PG/13\\): Fri
 day\, September 11th\, Veterans Memorial Park. Starting at 6 PM\, lay out 
 your blankets\, set up your lawn chairs\, and order dinner from Riley's Fo
 od Truck before the movie begins at approximately 8 PM/Dusk. This is a fre
 e event\, but reserving your tickets assists us with planning. \n\nA Good 
 Year was directed by Ridley Scott and stars Russell Crowe and Abbie Cornis
 h. This 2006 romantic comedy-drama follows British investment broker Max S
 kinner as he discovers he is the only known relative of his uncle Henry\, 
 so he inherits his Provence chateau and vineyard\, where he spent many of 
 his summers. As he spruces the estate to be sold\, he rediscovers what he 
 had loved about the place. \n\nJoining us at the event are Ludovic Dervin\
 , the General Manager and Senior Winemaker at Stags' Leap Winery\, a Nativ
 e of Champagne\, France\, as well as Jim Foster\, Sales Manager from Stags
 ' Leap Winery.  Ludovic and Jim will be pouring tastings of Stags' Leap Wi
 nes before the movie and giving us an introduction right before the film r
 olls. This is a free event\, open to everyone. \n\n\\*Please leave pets at
  home. Service animals are welcome.\\*
LOCATION:Veterans Memorial Park
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/outdoor-movie-in-the-park-
 a-good-year?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
