 ainting to take home\n\nNo experience is necessary. Recommended for ages 
 7 and up.\n\nAll materials and tools are provided.\n\nDetails:\n\n• $45 
 per person\n\n• Max 20 participants\n\n• Duration: 2 hours\n\nImportan
 t Notes:\n\n• Advance registration required\n\n• Workshops require a m
