BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ancestral Sounds of Mesoamerica for Kids
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T150000
UID:260821Z6TiaNlhDEyGn7n0rS6vXQ
DESCRIPTION:Join Jesus Bravo\, of Manos Mexicas\, for an exploration of ha
 nd carved instruments that were commonly used throughout Mesoamerica prior
  to colonization. Jesus will explain the instruments\, how they were creat
