SUMMARY:Sing for Joy! Musical Mosaic\, An Afternoon of Music\, Wine & Comm
 unity
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T170000
UID:260813tZRYY7bFwEqiYZUcA8vKIQ
DESCRIPTION:**Sing for Joy! Musical Mosaic\, An Afternoon of Music\, Wine 
 & Community.**\n\n**Join us for an unforgettable concert benefiting Sing N
 apa Valley!** Experience a joyful mix of opera\, Broadway\, art songs\, hu
 mor\, poetry\, and beloved classics performed by soprano Dr. Eve-Anne Wilk
 es\, tenor Bob Brown\, and pianist Ellen Patterson.\n\nSet in the beauty o
 f a private Coombsville vineyard\, *Sing for Joy! A Vocal Mosaic* promises
  an uplifting afternoon of artistry\, connection\, and celebration—compl
 ete with a charcuterie and wine reception. The funds from this benefit sup
 port Sing Napa Valley’s 6/27 season.\n\n**Sunday\, September 13\, 2026\,
  3:00 p.m.**\n\nPrivate Coombsville vineyard in Napa\n\nLocation address a
 vailable upon ticket purchase **Seats are limited—reserve yours today an
 d help support Sing Napa Valley’s 2026–27 season!**\n\nTickets: $40\, 
 including concert\, charcuterie\, and wine reception.\n\n**https://www.zef
 fy.com/en-US/ticketing/sing-for-joy-a-musical-mosaic**
LOCATION:Location of Venue Provided with Ticket Purchase
URL:https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/sing-for-joy-a-musical-mosaic
