 idos\, regional favorites\, and more . It's the perfect soundtrack for col
 d beer\, good company\, and a packed dance floor.\n\nThe music starts at 1
 0 PM \, making Jueves Sediento the place to keep the night going. Stop in 
 after dinner\, meet up with friends\, or make Barrel Proof your last stop 
 of the evening.\n\nEvery Thursday  Live Music • 10:00 PM Always FREE  
 No Cover  21+  Free Popcorn\n\nThursday Night Specials  Beer Bucket Spe
 cials  Rotating drink promotions throughout the night\n\nMusic\, dancing\
 , cold drinks\, and a room full of people ready to have a good time. That'
