UID:260820DcqsnS8CkECB88-17TqvPA
DESCRIPTION:Bring your instrument\, bring your friends\, and settle in for
  a night of live jazz at the Empress Marquee Club. Monday Jazz Jam is a we
 lcoming\, musician-friendly evening where players can sit in\, listeners c
 an enjoy a relaxed club atmosphere\, and the music moves naturally from sw
 inging standards to blues\, ballads\, Latin grooves\, and spontaneous impr
 ovisation.\n\nTogether\, they’ll anchor the night with taste\, experienc
 e\, and musical flexibility\, giving guest musicians a strong foundation t
 o step up and join the jam. Whether you’re a horn player\, vocalist\, gu
 itarist\, percussionist\, bassist\, pianist\, or simply a jazz lover\, thi
 s is a night built around community\, creativity\, and live interaction.\n
 \nMusicians play free and get dinner\, making this one of Vallejo’s most
  inviting weekly gatherings for working players\, students\, seasoned impr
 ovisers\, and music fans alike.\n\nThe jam runs from 7 PM to 10 PM\, with 
 doors and dinner beginning at 6 PM.
LOCATION:Empress Marquee Club
