  This luxurious wine tasting experience offers scenic views and a tranquil
  atmosphere\, nestled over the serene reservoir amidst wraparound vineyard
 s. Enjoy a tasting of expertly selected wines paired with seasonal small b
 ites for a curated tasting and pairing.\n\nThe Brandlin Estate Boathouse W
 ine & Food Pairing Experience features 6 wines. The Cuvaison Boathouse Win
 e & Food Pairing Experience features 5 wines.\n\nSet on the edge of the tr
 anquil estate reservoir and surrounded by vineyard views\, the Boathouses 
 offer a peaceful\, private setting for your tasting. Each 120-minute exper
 ience includes a guided flight of estate-grown wines from Cuvaison and Bra
 ndlin Estate\, two estates rooted in Napa Valley history. Together\, they 
 showcase our winemaking philosophy\, from the cool-climate elegance of Los
  Carneros to the bold character of mountain-grown reds from Mt. Veeder.\n\
